  // 🧪️ §C5 item 5: "viewers never checkpoint" — `canCheckIn` is the SAME predicate `ShellHost` gates
  // both the `#s-checkin`/checkpoint footer items (JSX presence, `!canCheckIn(session.app.role)`) and
